<title>USA: Cooper Cos files for 2 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Cooper Cos files for 2 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Cos Inc said Tuesday it has filed a prospectus for a public offering of two million common shares.</p>
<p>The shares will be newly issued by the company. The company said in a statement the managing underwriters for the offering are Deutsche Morgan Grenfell Inc and PaineWebber Inc.</p>
<p>The proposed sale is expected to begin in late July.</p>
</text>
